      "content": "i know people want to help but they dont get it. they cant just pay off the debt or fix the fact that i'm a failure. it's not just about being sad, it's just... mathematically impossible. there is no math that makes this work. i've looked at every number and it's just zero. it feels like the only logical thing left is to just stop. everything is just a loop of debt and shame.",
